{"ID":"20250328175829-syznqhk","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250328175829-syznqhk","title":"CPPS1L3——变量的本质","type":"doc","updated":"20250328182524"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328182502-rvyijjq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328182502-rvyijjq","updated":"20250328182524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250328182507-vb4jxy5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328182507-vb4jxy5","updated":"20250328182524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"sizeof()    // 获取变量类型所占的内存空间\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328175829-fku234d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328175829-fku234d","name":"sizeof()","updated":"20250328182046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量的存储空间（内存中）"}]},{"ID":"20250328180101-ye734ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328180101-ye734ln","updated":"20250328180151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"计算机中最小的存储单位为\"位\"("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"bit"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​)"}]},{"ID":"20250328181707-9q8wta7","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328181707-9q8wta7","updated":"20250328181728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"1byte = 8bit                 1字节 = 8位\n1KB   = 1024byte             1千字节 = 1024字节\n1MB   = 1024KB               1兆字节 = 1024千字节\n1GB   = 1024MB               1吉字节 = 1024兆字节\n1TB   = 1024GB               1太字节 = 1024吉字节\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328180155-z5jb176","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328180155-z5jb176","updated":"20250328180210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sizeof(变量类型)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 运算符，可以获取变量类型所占的内存空间（单位：字节）"}]},{"ID":"20250328181923-fpyhcpo","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250328181923-fpyhcpo","updated":"20250328182035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250328181924-f5gaykm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328181924-f5gaykm","updated":"20250328182035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::string"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 由于存储的内容可变，因此我们一般不通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sizeof()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 查看其内存空间大小\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::string"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中不仅会存储字符串本身的信息，还会存储一些字符串的基本信息（比如指针、长度信息、容量信息等等）"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328180228-4bsdbta","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328180228-4bsdbta","updated":"20250328181948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"//有符号\ncout \u003c\u003c \"有符号\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//[signed] short [int]      (-32768 ~ 32767)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"short所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(short) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//[signed] int              (-21亿多 ~ 21亿多)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"int所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(int) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//[signed] long [int]       (-21亿多 ~ 21亿多 或 -9223亿亿多 ~ 9223亿亿多 )\ncout \u003c\u003c \"long所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(long) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//[signed] long long [int]  (-9223亿亿多 ~ 9223亿亿多)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"long long所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(long long) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n\ncout \u003c\u003c \"无符号\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//无符号\n//unsigned short [int]      (0 ~ 65535)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"unsigned short所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(unsigned short) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//unsigned [int]            (0 ~ 42亿多)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"unsigned所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(unsigned) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//unsigned long [int]       (0 ~ 42亿多 或 0 ~ 18446亿亿多 )\ncout \u003c\u003c \"unsigned long所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(unsigned long) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//unsigned long long [int]  (0 ~ 18446亿亿多 )\ncout \u003c\u003c \"unsigned long long所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(unsigned long long) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n\ncout \u003c\u003c \"浮点数\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//浮点数\n//float         (-3.4*10^-38 ~ 3.4*10^38)       (6/7位有效数字) \ncout \u003c\u003c \"float所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(float) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//double        (-1.7*10^-308 ~ 1.7*10^308)     (15/16位有效数字)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"double所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(double) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//long double   (-1.1*10^-4932 ~ 1.1*10^4932等) (18/21、33/36位有效数字)   \ncout \u003c\u003c \"long double所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(long double) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n\ncout \u003c\u003c \"特殊\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//特殊\n//bool   (true1和false  0和1)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"bool所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(bool) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//char   (一个字符, ASCII编码)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"char所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(char) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n//string (一串字符)\ncout \u003c\u003c \"string所占字节数：\" \u003c\u003c sizeof(std::string) \u003c\u003c \"byte\" \u003c\u003c endl;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328181853-4xq5z9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328181853-4xq5z9m","updated":"20250328182002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出（Windows 平台）："}]},{"ID":"20250328181855-s5rqpbx","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328181855-s5rqpbx","updated":"20250328181857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"有符号\nshort所占字节数：2byte\nint所占字节数：4byte\nlong所占字节数：4byte\nlong long所占字节数：8byte\n无符号\nunsigned short所占字节数：2byte\nunsigned所占字节数：4byte\nunsigned long所占字节数：4byte\nunsigned long long所占字节数：8byte\n浮点数\nfloat所占字节数：4byte\ndouble所占字节数：8byte\nlong double所占字节数：8byte\n特殊\nbool所占字节数：1byte\nchar所占字节数：1byte\nstring所占字节数：40byte\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328182045-7np1mk7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328182045-7np1mk7","updated":"20250328182437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量的本质"}]},{"ID":"20250328182110-eh2qbxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328182110-eh2qbxn","updated":"20250328182142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量的本质是 2 进制，因为计算机中所有数据的本质都是二进制，也就是一堆 0 和 1\n为什么是 2 进制？数据传递只能通过电信号，只有开和关两种状态。所以就用0和1来表示这两种状态"}]},{"ID":"20250328182147-v867a0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328182147-v867a0r","updated":"20250328182242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"计算机中的存储单位最小为 bit（位），他只能表示0和1两个数字，1 bit 就是 1 个数，要么是 0 要么是 1\n为了方便数据表示，出现一个叫 byte（字节）的单位，它是由 8 个 bit 组成的存储单位。所以我们一般说一个字节为 8 位"}]},{"ID":"20250328182221-shvnm07","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328182221-shvnm07","updated":"20250328182222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"1byte = 0000 0000\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328182309-1s5f2l5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328182309-1s5f2l5","updated":"20250328182345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二进制与10进制相互转换规则"}]},{"ID":"20250328182309-sba7eoz","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250328182309-sba7eoz","updated":"20250328182345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328182309-hedrvrq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250328182309-hedrvrq","updated":"20250328182345"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328182309-mcb6xgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328182309-mcb6xgr","updated":"20250328182345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二进制转十进制：从右往左看 最右边一位为第 0 位，如果该位不为 0，则加上 2 的 n 位次方"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328182309-cm8hcg3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250328182309-cm8hcg3","updated":"20250328182309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328182309-t2e1ky0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328182309-t2e1ky0","updated":"20250328182309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十进制转二进制：除二取余，直到不能取为止"}]}]}]}]}